{"version":1,"key":"card:216","content":{"id":216,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c4e12e35-6232-4361-8167-82c491473e84","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"程序里很多地方会产生二进制数据。网络响应的响应体、读进来的文件、图片和音频的原始数据等。而在 JavaScript 的原始类型里没有能装字节的类型，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Number"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"String"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Boolean"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这些原始类型都不合适。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5784b3e5-9c3c-481a-9cca-605e4a925da1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"唯一合适的是数组，但在 JavaScript 中，一个数字使用 8 个字节来进行表示，这就意味着有 8 倍的空间浪费，并且，在一些需要原生消费字节类型的地方，我们还需要手动将数组元素一个个转化为需要的字节数据，带来了不必要的损耗。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"84d91a7e-1d2f-48b8-846b-9c0f5f24056b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这样的背景下，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个数据结构诞生了。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示占据一定字节的内存区域，通过调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 构造函数，可以分配指定数目字节的内存。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e74b10f2-0572-461b-9525-34c516194cb2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dc205c7e-868a-4ad1-b358-c02aef078579","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let buffer = new ArrayBuffer(10); // 分配 10 个字节的内存\nconsole.log(buffer);","collabId":"1264a051-d3eb-4852-8f66-2f57d2469831","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"3fc54e96-db81-4e15-b43a-e6d478b03fa8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"29b6a39f-14bc-4cb0-b0b8-205d398474af","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"ArrayBuffer {\n  [Uint8Contents]: <00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00>,\n  byteLength: 10\n}","collabId":"1f541ea2-43ad-4afb-b986-d3ceabebb435","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8863c2e3-0193-4593-a471-e162d07bbfa6","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只是一个存储字节的对象，如果需要操作这块内存，还需要借助 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7a39aded-b407-4c49-91c6-60b54e7e14b9","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 构造函数接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，除此之外还可以接收两个可选参数"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8709663c-8ec4-418c-9823-8c92d497217b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fc083a2b-0011-495b-9d71-b0b546bd80e2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0ccef0e-2c07-4dd4-91d2-b39823143ed2","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"byteOffset"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：偏移量，默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7622f946-1cea-4100-8e72-73b4f5f3c946","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3101aaa0-693d-4cb1-8b87-9138a7cdef61","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"byteLength"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：字节长度，默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"buffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的长度"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9fd89528-6842-4b32-9791-418eaaff2c64","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f92b1455-1440-4904-8533-10987e4765f1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const buffer = new ArrayBuffer(10);\nconst view = new DataView(buffer);","collabId":"a3012e13-1b75-4126-94a8-6a57c2fcc9c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d0cf5ae9-46bd-4971-9b6d-78b377af7f64","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象包含如下属性"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"5617de2a-0753-43db-9ee5-124eb19a1d3a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"937034cf-0967-4f4a-969d-aaa9b1eaa8bf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"beed4337-5761-4a1f-ac96-af81b9fbdb9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"buffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：传入构造函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fc5faf69-4627-4a3d-944b-bc3ded4e7b21","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2474e31b-b5d5-4084-b6a6-d9db8eaef1e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteOffset"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：传入构造函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteOffset"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"79b50acc-7c67-4e52-961c-1cd8e72602da","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"902d70b6-4b23-4f4a-b9bf-4e7d5bf48fbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteLength"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：传入构造函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteLength"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"44ea4aed-ef59-4df4-a3ec-02c4931d4d76","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5df367ba-d0ff-4546-8700-c8b80533f4ec","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const buffer = new ArrayBuffer(10);\nconst view1 = new DataView(buffer);\nconst view2 = new DataView(buffer, 2, 5);\n\nconsole.log(view1.buffer === view2.buffer); // true\n\nconsole.log(view1.byteOffset); // 0\nconsole.log(view1.byteLength); // 10\n\nconsole.log(view2.byteOffset); // 2\nconsole.log(view2.byteLength); // 5","collabId":"21e77779-e352-455c-a6ec-0c35a63bd376","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f238a1d-5aa7-4883-8f0f-c57469817b03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过下面的方法可以读取和设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"buffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的值，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是占位符，可选的值有 8、16、32、64："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f8b981ef-6717-451e-98b1-5a1bf73771ea","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"475ecd39-f460-4482-b828-b06cd7c5485c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"822a379e-9d18-4dc1-ac90-aba566e2a7bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getIntx(offset, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6d86c46d-fe40-450d-bb87-dbc8f43a58a9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9137dcc8-95f3-4b92-8c16-6ee192f87aa0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setIntx(offset, value, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"512eaf8c-fe2b-4347-8c7d-02ef75640725","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5ae71167-ab36-4bca-9a98-7486ed762d59","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getUIntx(offset, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8a4322d2-5281-4eac-a6bc-5957306a2f57","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c723d4a1-94ae-4e88-b7e2-d550ccf9c5c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setUIntx(offset, value, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c7a17b63-7e07-4b2d-8a55-c88fa5da11aa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2100a366-7b8f-42c6-ba6c-d2724db62723","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getFloat32(offset, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0050ec1b-c79b-4fa9-87f5-009875f7f8a4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43a44f00-e5f5-4e56-98e3-81b5a60ba80c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setFloat32(offset, value, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"73a220d0-6677-4fe0-baa9-c7346fff1f65","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ac50aa3-c73d-4265-9af1-544ee3247fe7","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getFloat64(offset, littleEndian)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0b361f32-a3a5-4ffe-bbcc-b35f6fd34b5e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"32d203c6-bb44-4dbc-b761-b7746e043d3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setFloat64(offset, value, littleEndian)"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0d332974-cf21-414b-879d-308f7d40b868","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d599768f-6058-4919-91aa-6c6a0719c252","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let buffer = new ArrayBuffer(10);\nlet view = new DataView(buffer);\n\n// 0000 1010\nview.setInt8(0, 10);\n// 1000 1010 补码 1111 0110\nview.setInt8(1, -10);\n\nlet s = view.getInt8(0);\nconsole.log(s); // 10\n\n// 1111 0110 => 246\ns = view.getUint8(1);\nconsole.log(s); // 246","collabId":"ae5cf2c1-b424-4590-83c7-19f258a0e50e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"668287d4-e5a5-474c-9dd3-23f40fcdc0b4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f3a80f77-8bcc-4923-bf63-2b6346aa56ca","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 3F 80 00 00\nview.setFloat32(0, 1);\n// 3F 80 00 00\nview.setFloat32(2, 1);\n\n// 3F 80 00 00 3F 80 00 00\nres = view.getFloat64(0);\nconsole.log(res); // 0.007933616638183594","collabId":"5c1fa6e4-e514-46a2-a5af-457412b89819","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/ArrayBuffer","JavaScript/DataView"],"createTime":1690709646650,"updateTime":1791450154196,"linkedCards":[{"id":217,"target":{"key":"card:217","type":"card","id":217},"summary":"通过 DataView 读取 ArrayBuffer 中的内容是没有任何限制的，可以随便的读取，可能造成问题，另外 DataView 暴露的接口过于底层，难以使用。定型数组解决这个问题，可以认为定型数组是一个带了类型预设的 DataView...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791450154196}}